codex
The initial estimates already show the central pattern: raw CPS comparison is severely biased; nearest-neighbor matching gets close only after adding prior earnings, while several other defensible specifications remain far from the experiment. I’m correcting an inference-output detail now, then I’ll finalize the memo around that specification dependence.
